P.ui["Press Ctrl+C to copy this link, then paste it into your browser to send it, or post it on our Discord. It has your question, where you were and the answer you got, but not your character's name."] = "Apasa Ctrl+C pentru a copia acest link, apoi lipeste-l in browser ca sa-l trimiti sau posteaza-l pe Discordul nostru. Contine intrebarea ta, locul in care erai si raspunsul primit, dar nu si numele personajului tau."
P.ui["Press Ctrl+C to copy, then paste it at loreforeverwow.com/feedback (Something's broken) or in our Discord."] = "Apasa Ctrl+C pentru a copia, apoi lipeste la loreforeverwow.com/feedback (Something's broken) sau pe serverul nostru Discord."
P.ui["Press Ctrl+C to send your question. The answer appears on your screen in a few seconds."] = "Apasa Ctrl+C pentru a trimite intrebarea. Raspunsul va aparea pe ecran in cateva secunde."
