P.ui["When you enter a dungeon, link its primer in chat, and each boss's story once you beat them."] = "Cand intri intr-o temnita, trimite in chat ghidul acesteia, apoi povestea fiecarui sef dupa ce il invingi."
P.ui["When you enter a zone whose places and people are narrated in a voice pack you don't have, say so once."] = "Cand intri intr-o zona ale carei locuri si personaje sunt narate intr-un pachet de voci pe care nu-l ai, anunta o singura data."
P.ui["When you enter a zone, suggest a question about it in chat."] = "Cand intri intr-o zona, propune in chat o intrebare despre ea."
